# jump-note — шаги записи (что показывается — jump-note.md)
# Команды меняют только место каретки: `expect` держит, что текст не тронут, место каретки
# проверяется кадрами. Подсветка идёт за кареткой (шаг инструмента 2026-10-04).
title Jump inside a note | Hop the cursor between sections and lines
# Каркас 2026-10-05: Default Obsidian — стрелка вниз идёт по каждой строке; затем включение на камеру.
preset navigation.jumpToHeader.enabled = false
# Заметка влезает в окно: центровка прыжка только сдвигала её и резала верх.
preset navigation.jumpToHeader.centerCursor = false
open Week notes.md
caret ## Monday
mark caret
stage Default Obsidian
say Obsidian: ↓ walks through every line
key ArrowDown
key ArrowDown
key ArrowDown
key ArrowDown
expect ## Monday / 1. call the plumber / ## Tuesday / ## Wednesday

stage Jump between headings
say Jump between headings → on
settings Navigation
set Jump between headings = on
caret ## Monday
say Jump down stops at the end of a section…
cmd jump-next
say …then at the start of the next one
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
say Jump up walks back the same way
cmd jump-back
expect ## Monday / 1. call the plumber / ## Tuesday / ## Wednesday

stage Start only
say Where in the section → Start only
settings Navigation
set Where in the section = Start only
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → only the first line of each section
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday / ## Tuesday / ## Wednesday

stage Jump target: Lines
say Jump target → Lines
settings Navigation
set Jump target = Lines
caret ## Monday
say Jump down → line by line, headings included
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
cmd jump-next
expect ## Monday / ## Tuesday / ## Wednesday
